// Scene Setup - Day 2
After thinking about Suresh's story all night, Raju returns to the auto stand, determined to prove his commitment runs deeper than fantasy.

The morning bustle provides a familiar backdrop as Raju approaches for the second day. His resolve has strengthened, not weakened.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: Back again, champ? I thought after yesterday's reality check, you might decide to focus on safer pursuits.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Quizzical">>
Suresh: Didn't get scared off by my lecture about the harsh world of professional cricket?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: No, bhaiya. I spent all night thinking about your story.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: And it made me realize something important.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: You didn't fail at cricket - you chose family responsibility over personal dreams.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: That shows character, not weakness.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: That's a mature way to look at it, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Quizzical">>
Suresh: But tell me - what exactly did you learn from my experience?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: How will you approach this differently? What specific steps will you take?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: That's what I want to talk about, bhaiya.

<<AutoAdvance true>>
