<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I understand now that talent alone isn't enough.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: I need to be smart, persistent, and realistic about building support systems.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: Dreams are heavy, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: Only those with strong shoulders and smart strategies can carry them to success.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: I'm beginning to think you have both.

