// Scene Setup - Day 4
With three days of accumulated wisdom from Suresh, Raju visits once more to express gratitude and understand how their relationship might continue.

The auto stand has transformed into the site of meaningful mentorship. Four days of wisdom and respect have created a relationship that transcends their differences.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: My regular visitor returns!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: I can see something different in your posture today, champ.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: Not just eagerness to learn, but confidence from having absorbed lessons.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Bhaiya, I wanted to thank you properly for everything you've taught me.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: Over these past few days, you've changed how I think about cricket.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: Not just as something I love to play, but as a long-term project.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: One that requires intelligence, strategy, and character development.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: You absorbed the lessons well, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: More importantly, you took difficult truths about obstacles.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: And transformed them into practical strategies rather than excuses.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: That shows the kind of character that separates achievers from dreamers.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Your experience has been like a guidebook, bhaiya.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: For avoiding mistakes and building support systems.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: I feel much more prepared now to face the challenges ahead.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: And I want you to know, champ, that my investment in your success doesn't end here.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: It doesn't end with just advice and encouragement.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: When the day comes that you need practical support - you call me.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: Practical support? What do you mean, bhaiya?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: Transportation to tournaments, help reaching coaching facilities.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: Even references for scholarship applications.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: You would really do that, bhaiya? Provide practical help beyond just guidance?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: Absolutely. Listen, maybe I couldn't complete my own cricket journey.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: But helping you succeed with yours...

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: That would give my experience meaning and purpose beyond just cautionary tales.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: When you need to reach that academy for trials...

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: Or get to a tournament on time...

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: Or have someone vouch for your character to coaches - I'm your ally in this fight.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Serious">>
Suresh: A young cricketer should never miss opportunities because of bus fare or lack of adult support.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Bhaiya, you're not just helping me pursue cricket.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: You're showing me what it means to support others' dreams.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: Even when your own didn't work out. That's incredible generosity.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: You know what, beta? Through our conversations, I've realized something important.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: My cricket story didn't end in failure.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: It just took a different path than I originally planned.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: Now it continues through helping the next generation navigate challenges more successfully.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: So in a way, when I succeed at cricket, it's also a success for your cricket dreams?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: Exactly, champ!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: Your victories will carry forward everything valuable from my experience.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: While avoiding the mistakes and limitations that stopped me.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: That makes us partners in this journey, not just teacher and student.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Partners! I like that, bhaiya.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: We're building something together.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Excited">>
Suresh: Yes, beta. Something that honors both our dreams.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: Thank you, bhaiya. For everything.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Suresh" "Smiling">>
Suresh: No, thank you, champ. You've given my story a happy ending after all.

<<HideCharacter>>

// Scene Conclusion
As Raju departs carrying practical guidance and ongoing support promises, he recognizes that Suresh's mentorship embodies the power of community support to overcome systemic barriers.

